      "outputs": [],
      "title": "READ ME · Krea 2 character Ingredients-sheet generator",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# SineForge · Krea 2 Character Ingredients Sheet — high-resolution mode\n\n1. Node 2 now defaults to a real high-resolution character reference sheet instead of a tiny placeholder. Pick any copied sheet from `SineForge/CharacterIngredients/` or upload your own clean identity image.\n2. Edit only `character_profile_json` in node 1. Keep it valid JSON and preserve every declared schema key. Describe one character through `identity_brief`, `age_presentation`, `face_identity`, `hair`, `complexion`, `body_build`, locked `wardrobe`, `accessories`, `identity_locks`, `visual_style`, `background`, and `avoid`.\n3. The planner model is a visible dropdown populated from every installed GGUF package under the local LM Studio model root. Qwen 3.6 40B is selected by default, but any listed local model may be chosen. The planner emits one strict JSON record plus four view-specific Krea prompts and four independent seeds. No hosted/API model is used.\n4. Every Krea branch receives the same high-resolution identity/reference sheet through the available conditioning slots. The branches generate a front face, three-quarter face, profile, and body turnaround.\n5. Face views use 1024×1024 latents. The body turnaround uses 1024×1536. All samplers use 8 steps, CFG 1, ER-SDE, simple schedule, batch size one.\n6. Node 50 creates a clean 1536×1920 `wide_bottom` Ingredients sheet with a black background and no labels. Node 51 saves that result as a lossless 16-bit PNG container. Node 52 saves the full JSON prompt/provenance record.\n7. For LTX Ingredients conditioning, clean high-resolution image panels are more valuable than text labels, clutter, or tiny placeholders. If one view is weak, change the planner seed/profile or use a stronger reference sheet; do not add labels to compensate.\n\nCopied high-resolution sheets available in ComfyUI input:\n- `SineForge/CharacterIngredients/jesus_white_robe_highres_ingredients.png`\n- `SineForge/CharacterIngredients/peter_dark_brown_robe_highres_ingredients.png`\n- `SineForge/CharacterIngredients/moses_gray_robe_highres_ingredients.png`\n- `SineForge/CharacterIngredients/elijah_dark_robe_highres_ingredients.png`\n- `SineForge/CharacterIngredients/john_light_robe_highres_ingredients.png`\n- `SineForge/CharacterIngredients/james_olive_robe_highres_ingredients.png`\n"
      ],
      "color": "#26354f",
      "bgcolor": "#172237"
    }
